You now have a [6%, 15%, 21%, 24%, 27% (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] chance to Fold Fate, Gravity, or Warp into your Weapon Folding damage.

Fold Fate: Deals [16, 35, 49, 61, 71 (TL1-5; SP 100; PARADOX 300)] temporal damage to enemies in a radius of [1, 1, 1, 2, 2 (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)].  Affected targets may lose 30% physical and temporal resistance for 2 turns.

Fold Warp: Deals [8.10, 17, 24, 30, 36 (TL1-5; SP 100; PARADOX 300)] physical and [8.10, 17, 24, 30, 36 (TL1-5; SP 100; PARADOX 300)] temporal damage to enemies in a radius of [1, 1, 1, 2, 2 (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)].  Affected targets may be stunned, blinded, confused, or pinned for 2 turns.

Fold Gravity: Deals [16, 35, 49, 61, 71 (TL1-5; SP 100; PARADOX 300)] physical damage to enemies in a radius of [1, 1, 1, 2, 2 (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)].  Affected targets will be slowed (30%) for 2 turns.

Each Fold has an eight turn cooldown.  If an effect would be triggered while on cooldown it will reduce the cooldown of the other two Folds by one turn.
